        1487,
        2517
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "All agency and department heads and all personnel employed in such agencies or departments are instructed that all proposals for inter-agency and inter-departmental transfers must be submitted to the Office of the Deputy Mayor for his approval. Such proposals must be accompanied by: (a) full statements of justification by: (i) the individual seeking the transfer, and (ii) the department or agency head soliciting it, and",
